{"id":"n74795-1-10","stage":3,"title":"전원 · 全员","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74795-1-10-1","ko":"모두 다 버스에 탔니?","zh":"大家都上公交车了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"모두","meaning":"都，全","explanation":"모두：都，全","readings":[{"term":"모두","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28135","senseId":"1","lemma":"모두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58176","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"버스에","meaning":"公共汽车，公交车","explanation":"버스：公共汽车，公交车；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"버스","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36678","senseId":"1","lemma":"버스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"탔니?","meaning":"乘，乘坐","explanation":"타다：乘，乘坐；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2576dfb09ecb81b9","term":"모두","zh":"都，全","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3","entryId":"28135","definition":"一个不漏，全都。","pronunciation":["모두"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58176","definition":"一点不剩或不落下而全部。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"fb84fa7f86eac62e","term":"버스","zh":"公共汽车，公交车","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3","entryId":"36678","definition":"收取费用、按照规定路线行驶、可乘坐多人的大汽车。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"乘，乘坐","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"17160","definition":"坐到交通工具或当作交通工具的动物背上。","pronunciation":["타다"]}],"audio":"/audio/64b32f40c47ca8c530f4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n74795-1-10-2","ko":"네, 스무 명 전원 버스에 탑승했습니다!","zh":"是的，二十个人全都已经上了公交车！","note":"点不懂的词，看